# Mosquitto ACL — least-privilege topic access.
#
# Topic scheme:
#   evolights/<device_id>/cmd     api → device   (commands)
#   evolights/<device_id>/state   device → api   (status, telemetry)
#   evolights/<device_id>/ota     api → device   (signed OTA manifest)
#   evolights/<device_id>/log     device → api   (debug logs, opt-in)

# The api service has full read/write across the namespace.
user api
topic readwrite evolights/#

# Per-device users are appended below by the pairing service.
# Pattern (substituted at write time):
#   user dev_<device_id>
#   topic write evolights/<device_id>/state
#   topic write evolights/<device_id>/log
#   topic read  evolights/<device_id>/cmd
#   topic read  evolights/<device_id>/ota
